! Written disabled, matching nothing:
!   firewall 2 (BLOCK-BAD-V6): the rule matches no IPv4 address: the router's policies are IPv4
!   firewall 3 (ADMIN-SSH (port2)): zones port2: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2)
!   firewall 4 (ADMIN-SSH (port1)): zones port1: a policy names the interfaces lan, wan1, wan2 or all (give --zone-map ZONE=lan|wan1|wan2)
!   firewall 7 (WEB-IN): not converted: action Dst NAT: how the API spells its target list is not known, so the translation is not read
!   firewall 19 (UPDATES): 'Updates (IPv4)' holds members only its platform knows
!   firewall 20 (V6-WEB): the rule matches no IPv4 address: the router's policies are IPv4
!   firewall 22 (GRE-LAB): IP protocol 47: a policy names all, TCP, UDP or ICMP
!   firewall 23 (TO-LAB): not converted: action Cascade: the rules of the rule list it hands traffic to are not read, and they decide that traffic
!   firewall 24 (ODD): schedule '{"type": "recurring", "name": "Work-Hours"}' is not converted; the rule would apply at all times
